./AUDIT_REPORT.md:59:| Min order quote | `max(exchange_min, user_min, legacy_min)` | lower values among `AUTONOMOUS_EXCHANGE_MIN_ORDER_QUOTE_FALLBACK`, `AUTONOMOUS_USER_MIN_ORDER_QUOTE`, `AUTONOMOUS_MIN_ORDER_NOTIONAL_QUOTE` | Effective min order quote is always the strictest maximum. |
